---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "One Beat · The Robotic Time Crystal"
	: "同拍 · ONE BEAT";
const description = isEn
	? "One Beat: Exploring wave coarsening and autonomous time crystallization in mechatronic metamaterials. A network of active robotic units linked by nonreciprocal forces spontaneously synchronizes into a single collective rhythm without a central controller (Nature 2026)."
	: "同拍 · ONE BEAT：探索机械超材料中的时间晶体与波粗化现象。阿姆斯特丹大学等团队在《自然》（Nature 2026）发表成果：由微型机器人单胞构成的弹性超材料通过非互易相互作用打破时间平移对称性，无需中央时钟即可自主涌现全局同步律动。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#070b14] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-indigo-500/30 selection:text-indigo-200">
			<!-- Ambient Laboratory Glow & Grid -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#818cf8_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-80 h-80 bg-indigo-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/4 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 bg-fuchsia-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<header class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span>NATURE · 2026-10-14 · VEENSTRA ET AL.</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>🤖</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">机电超材料 · 宏观时间晶体</span>
							<span class="lang-en">MECHATRONIC METAMATERIAL · TIME CRYSTAL</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">2026-10-14 发表 · DOI: 10.1038/s41586-026-11163-6</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Published 2026-10-14 · DOI: 10.1038/s41586-026-11163-6</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">同拍 · ONE BEAT</span>
					<span class="lang-en">One Beat · The Robotic Time Crystal</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-indigo-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">没有指挥家，没有中央时钟：非互易机器人在波的吞噬中跳出同一节拍。</span>
					<span class="lang-en">No conductor, no central clock: nonreciprocal robotic units coarsen into a shared pulse.</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							2026 年 10 月 14 日，《自然》（Nature）发表了由荷兰阿姆斯特丹大学 Corentin Coulais 团队领衔、伯明翰大学、里昂高等师范学院、代尔夫特理工大学、莱顿大学与剑桥大学联合完成的里程碑成果。他们构建了一种突破传统的“机电超材料”：其基本单元不是微观晶格中的无机原子，而是一台台搭载微传感器、微处理器与定制洛伦兹驱动器的微型机器人。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							On October 14, 2026, Nature published a landmark study led by Corentin Coulais at the University of Amsterdam in collaboration with Birmingham, Lyon, Delft, Leiden, and Cambridge. The team created a mechatronic metamaterial whose fundamental building blocks are not passive atoms or quantum spins, but active robotic units equipped with custom Lorentz actuators, sensors, and distributed microelectronics.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							当单元间的机械相互作用打破牛顿第三定律的对称性——单元 A 对单元 B 的推力不等于 B 对 A 的推力（非互易性，Nonreciprocal）——整个材料便打破了时间平移对称性。最初杂乱微弱的高频微波在材料中自发激荡，并通过非线性“波粗化”（Wave Coarsening）过程不断相互吞并，波长、周期与振幅逐级攀升，最终让整片原本各自为政的机械网络凝结为单一周期的宏观搏动——诞生了一座无需任何中央时钟调度的机器人时间晶体。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							By configuring neighbour interactions to be nonreciprocal (Unit A's push on Unit B does not equal B's push on A), the material breaks continuous time-translation symmetry. Subtle local fluctuations spontaneously emerge and progressively coalesce through "wave coarsening" — small ripples merge into longer wavelengths and larger amplitudes until the entire lattice pulses in a single, robust collective cadence: an autonomous robotic time crystal.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Key Stats Row -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mt-6">
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">实验拓扑单元</span>
							<span class="lang-en">ACTIVE TOPOLOGIES</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-black text-white mt-1">37 / 24</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">37 单元 2D 蜂窝晶格 · 24 单元弹性环</span>
							<span class="lang-en">37-unit 2D honeycomb · 24-unit elastic ring</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">集体自激振荡频率</span>
							<span class="lang-en">OSCILLATION FREQUENCY</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-black text-indigo-300 mt-1">~30 Hz</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">突破非互易稳定性阈值后的自发全局律动</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Emergent collective pulse past stability threshold</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-fuchsia-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">硬件规模与执行器</span>
							<span class="lang-en">HARDWARE SUBSYSTEMS</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-black text-fuchsia-300 mt-1">&gt; 100</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">3D 打印弹性骨架 · 定制洛伦兹驱动器网络</span>
							<span class="lang-en">3D-printed flexures · Custom Lorentz actuators</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</header>

			<!-- 1. HONEYCOMB LAB (37-UNIT ACTIVE LATTICE) -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12 pb-10 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-1">
							<span>LAB 01</span>
							<span>·</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">37 单元蜂窝晶格波粗化实验台</span>
							<span class="lang-en">37-Unit Honeycomb Wave Coarsening Lab</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">蜂窝超材料：从相位碎裂到全局同拍</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Honeycomb Metamaterial: Patchy Chaos to Global Sync</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-300">
						<span class="lang-zh">⚠️ 启发自实验的相位振子示意模型，非硬件物理复刻。</span>
						<span class="lang-en">⚠️ Illustrative phase model inspired by the experiment, not a replica of the hardware.</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-6">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						下方由 37 个微型机电单胞组成同心六角蜂窝晶格（1 + 6 + 12 + 18 结构）。节点颜色表示单胞实时相位 $\theta_i \in [0, 2\pi)$，节点半径伴随搏动微幅呼吸。当非互易度 $\eta$ 处于低位时，晶格局限于斑块状混沌与局部缺陷；当滑块跨越临界阈值（$\eta > 0.40$），高频涟漪发生非线性碰撞吞并，波长迅速放大，最终整个晶格同步锁死在同一脉搏中（同步序参量 $R \to 1$）。
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						The canvas simulates 37 active mechatronic cells arranged in a concentric hexagonal lattice (1 + 6 + 12 + 18 layout). Node colors denote instantaneous phase $\theta_i \in [0, 2\pi)$, while node radii subtly breathe with amplitude. When nonreciprocity $\eta$ remains low, the lattice stays trapped in patchy disorder. Once $\eta$ crosses the stability threshold ($\eta > 0.40$), short waves coarsen into long waves, driving the order parameter $R(t)$ toward unity (global synchronization).
					</span>
				</p>

				<!-- Main Honeycomb Canvas & Live Telemetry Layout -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start">
					<!-- Canvas Display Column (7 cols) -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-[#050811] rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
						<!-- Phase Color Map Legend Bar -->
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-2 px-1">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
								<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span>
								<span class="lang-zh">相位 0 / 2π</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Phase 0 / 2π</span>
							</div>
							<div class="h-2 w-32 rounded-full bg-linear-to-r from-indigo-500 via-cyan-400 via-emerald-400 via-amber-400 via-rose-500 to-indigo-500"></div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
								<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
								<span class="lang-zh">相位 π (反相)</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Phase π (Inverted)</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Canvas element -->
						<div class="relative w-full aspect-square max-h-[460px] flex items-center justify-center">
							<canvas id="honeycomb-canvas" class="w-full h-full block rounded-xl cursor-crosshair"></canvas>
							<!-- Disturbance overlay banner -->
							<div id="honeycomb-alert" class="absolute top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 border border-rose-500/60 text-rose-300 font-mono text-xs opacity-0 transition-opacity pointer-events-none">
								<span class="lang-zh">💥 注入随机相位扰动！波粗化正在修复有序态...</span>
								<span class="lang-en">💥 Phase perturbation injected! Wave coarsening restoring order...</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="mt-2 text-center text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
							<span class="lang-zh">提示：点击晶格上的任意单元可直接“敲击”（Poke）局部相位</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Tip: Click any cell on the lattice to directly poke its local phase</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Controls & Live Readouts Column (5 cols) -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4 font-mono">
						<!-- Telemetry Card 1: Synchrony Order Parameter R(t) -->
						<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
								<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-indigo-300 font-bold">
									<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 animate-ping"></span>
									<span class="lang-zh">同步序参量 R(t)</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Order Parameter R(t)</span>
								</div>
								<span id="hc-r-val" class="text-lg font-black text-white">0.982</span>
							</div>

							<!-- Sparkline canvas for R(t) history -->
							<div class="h-16 w-full bg-slate-950/80 rounded-lg p-1 border border-slate-800/80 relative my-2">
								<canvas id="hc-sparkline-canvas" class="w-full h-full block"></canvas>
								<div class="absolute right-2 bottom-1 text-[10px] text-slate-500">
									<span class="lang-zh">1.0 = 纯同拍</span>
									<span class="lang-en">1.0 = Pure Sync</span>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400">
								<span>
									<span class="lang-zh">状态: </span>
									<span class="lang-en">State: </span>
									<strong id="hc-state-badge" class="text-indigo-400">
										<span class="lang-zh">时间晶体全局同拍</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Time Crystal Sync</span>
									</strong>
								</span>
								<span>
									<span class="lang-zh">自振频率: </span>
									<span class="lang-en">Freq: </span>
									<strong class="text-slate-200">~29.8 Hz</strong>
								</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Telemetry Card 2: Estimated Dominant Wavelength -->
						<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800">
							<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
								<span class="lang-zh">空间主导波长 (Estimated Dominant λ)</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Dominant Wavelength (λ)</span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
								<span id="hc-lambda-val" class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-400">λ → ∞</span>
								<span id="hc-lambda-desc" class="text-xs text-slate-400">
									<span class="lang-zh">系统级同相搏动（粗化终点）</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Lattice-scale uniform pulse (Coarsened)</span>
								</span>
							</div>
							<div class="w-full bg-slate-950 rounded-full h-1.5 mt-3 overflow-hidden border border-slate-800">
								<div id="hc-lambda-bar" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-cyan-400 to-indigo-500 h-full w-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Interactive Controls Panel -->
						<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
							<div class="text-xs text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">
								<span class="lang-zh">🎛️ 晶格动力学调控</span>
								<span class="lang-en">🎛️ Lattice Control Deck</span>
							</div>

							<!-- Action Buttons -->
							<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
								<button id="hc-btn-play" type="button" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-xs transition active:scale-95 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer">
									<span id="hc-play-icon">⏸</span>
									<span id="hc-play-text">
										<span class="lang-zh">暂停</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Pause</span>
									</span>
								</button>
								<button id="hc-btn-poke" type="button" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-amber-300 font-bold text-xs transition active:scale-95 cursor-pointer" title="Randomize a local patch of phases">
									<span>⚡</span>
									<span class="lang-zh">局部敲击</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Poke</span>
								</button>
								<button id="hc-btn-reset" type="button" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 font-bold text-xs transition active:scale-95 cursor-pointer">
									<span>↺</span>
									<span class="lang-zh">重置</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Reset</span>
								</button>
							</div>

							<!-- Sliders -->
							<div class="space-y-3 pt-1 text-xs">
								<!-- Nonreciprocity Slider -->
								<div>
									<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
										<span class="font-bold text-slate-200">
											<span class="lang-zh">非互易性强度 (Nonreciprocity η)</span>
											<span class="lang-en">Nonreciprocity (η)</span>
										</span>
										<span id="hc-val-eta" class="text-indigo-400 font-bold">0.85</span>
									</div>
									<input id="hc-slider-eta" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.85" class="w-full accent-indigo-500 cursor-pointer" />
									<div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">
										<span>0.0 (<span class="lang-zh">完全对称互易</span><span class="lang-en">Reciprocal</span>)</span>
										<span class="text-indigo-400/80 font-bold">↑ 0.40 (<span class="lang-zh">阈值</span><span class="lang-en">Threshold</span>)</span>
										<span>1.0 (<span class="lang-zh">完全非互易</span><span class="lang-en">Max Active</span>)</span>
									</div>
								</div>

								<!-- Coupling Strength Slider -->
								<div>
									<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
										<span class="text-slate-300">
											<span class="lang-zh">邻域耦合强度 (Coupling K)</span>
											<span class="lang-en">Coupling (K)</span>
										</span>
										<span id="hc-val-k" class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">1.20</span>
									</div>
									<input id="hc-slider-k" type="range" min="0.2" max="2.5" step="0.05" value="1.20" class="w-full accent-cyan-500 cursor-pointer" />
								</div>

								<!-- Noise Level Slider -->
								<div>
									<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
										<span class="text-slate-300">
											<span class="lang-zh">环境噪声水平 (Noise σ)</span>
											<span class="lang-en">Noise Level (σ)</span>
										</span>
										<span id="hc-val-noise" class="text-amber-400 font-bold">0.05</span>
									</div>
									<input id="hc-slider-noise" type="range" min="0" max="0.4" step="0.01" value="0.05" class="w-full accent-amber-500 cursor-pointer" />
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- 2. RING LAB (24-UNIT MOTORIZED RING & MODE COARSENING) -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12 pb-10 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-1">
							<span>LAB 02</span>
							<span>·</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">24 单元弹性环模式粗化实验台</span>
							<span class="lang-en">24-Unit Elastic Ring Mode Coarsening Lab</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">弹性环波级联：高频涟漪向基频模式的单向粗化</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Elastic Ring Cascade: High-Mode Ripples Merging to Mode-1</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs">
						<button id="ring-btn-restart" type="button" class="py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg bg-cyan-600 hover:bg-cyan-500 text-white font-bold transition active:scale-95 cursor-pointer">
							<span>↺</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">激发高频涟漪 (Mode 6)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Restart Ripple (Mode 6)</span>
						</button>
						<button id="ring-btn-speed" type="button" class="py-1.5 px-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-cyan-300 font-bold transition active:scale-95 cursor-pointer">
							<span class="lang-zh">速度: </span><span class="lang-en">Speed: </span><span id="ring-speed-text">1.0×</span>
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-6">
					<span class="lang-zh">
